&lt;b&gt;Corps &#224; corps&lt;/b&gt; morsure, +12 (2d6+10 plus &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Croc-En-Jambe-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Croc-en-jambe (Ext)&quot;&gt;croc-en-jambe&lt;/a&gt;)
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;BDtexte&quot;&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Espace occup&#233;&lt;/b&gt; 3 m ; &lt;b&gt;Allonge&lt;/b&gt; 3 m
&lt;/div&gt;
